# Cortex Code hook (Stop + SessionEnd): export the current session's record into
 this repo.                                                                     #
# Registered in ~/.snowflake/cortex/hooks.json. Cortex Code pipes a JSON payload
 on stdin                                                                       # with session_id and cwd. The hook only acts when the session's working directo
ry is                                                                           # inside this repo, so sessions for other projects are never touched. Exports ar
e keyed                                                                         # by session id (see tools/export_session.py), so each session gets its own file
s and                                                                           # nothing is overwritten. It skips git-history/ (--no-git) so commits don't crea
te churn;                                                                       # refresh that by running the exporter yourself before the final commit. It neve
r commits                                                                       # or pushes, prints nothing to stdout, and always exits 0, so it cannot block or
 alter a turn.                                                                  
